      "text": "Decode source names to home-relative paths.\ndot_config/nvim -> ~/.config/nvim\nUse private_, executable_ and empty_.\nCanonical encoding escapes reserved names.\nNo IDs, fallback paths or per-root manifests.\nFile contents remain original bytes.",
      "originalText": "Decode source names to home-relative paths.\ndot_config/nvim -> ~/.config/nvim\nUse private_, executable_ and empty_.\nCanonical encoding escapes reserved names.\nNo IDs, fallback paths or per-root manifests.\nFile contents remain original bytes.",
