      "text": "Manage selected paths and tracked children.\nMerge redundant parent/child selections.\nA missing or unreadable selection pauses sync.\nNever infer deletion from an unavailable path.\nDo not overwrite unrelated local files.",
      "originalText": "Manage selected paths and tracked children.\nMerge redundant parent/child selections.\nA missing or unreadable selection pauses sync.\nNever infer deletion from an unavailable path.\nDo not overwrite unrelated local files.",
