      "updated": 1792242472322,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Use selection-relative ignore patterns.\nExclude Abode config/storage and nested Git\nentries. Exclusion does not delete local files.\nUse empty_ for empty files; defer empty dirs.\nPreserve attributes in encoded names.\nReject symlinks initially, including parents.",
      "originalText": "Use selection-relative ignore patterns.\nExclude Abode config/storage and nested Git\nentries. Exclusion does not delete local files.\nUse empty_ for empty files; defer empty dirs.\nPreserve attributes in encoded names.\nReject symlinks initially, including parents.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
