      "text": "chezmoi: separate source and destination;\nencode paths and attributes in source names.\nStow: ownership and conflict checks.\nyadm: ordinary file bytes and Git recovery.\nAbode adds automatic sync with local\npath selections and conflict resolution.",
      "originalText": "chezmoi: separate source and destination;\nencode paths and attributes in source names.\nStow: ownership and conflict checks.\nyadm: ordinary file bytes and Git recovery.\nAbode adds automatic sync with local\npath selections and conflict resolution.",
