      "updated": 1792242393208,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": ".git/                       # local Git internals\ndot_config/\n  nvim/\n    init.lua\n    lua/\n      plugins.lua\n    scripts/\n      executable_setup.sh\n  kitty/\n    kitty.conf\ndot_zshrc\nprivate_dot_ssh/\n  private_config\n\nThe tracked tree is identical on GitHub.\n.git/ is local; config.toml stays outside the source tree.\nNo generated root folders or content/ wrappers.\nNo metadata.json or headers in file contents.\nDecoded paths identify managed destinations.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": ".git/                       # local Git internals\ndot_config/\n  nvim/\n    init.lua\n    lua/\n      plugins.lua\n    scripts/\n      executable_setup.sh\n  kitty/\n    kitty.conf\ndot_zshrc\nprivate_dot_ssh/\n  private_config\n\nThe tracked tree is identical on GitHub.\n.git/ is local; config.toml stays outside the source tree.\nNo generated root folders or content/ wrappers.\nNo metadata.json or headers in file contents.\nDecoded paths identify managed destinations.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
