      "text": "Source-name encoding replaces metadata.json",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Source-name encoding replaces metadata.json",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "repo-guide-metadata-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2900,
      "y": 1025,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 552.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c910",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 930011,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 930011,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792242472322,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Destination                 Source path\n~/.zshrc                    dot_zshrc\n~/.config/nvim/init.lua\n  -> dot_config/nvim/init.lua\n~/.config/nvim/scripts/setup.sh (executable)\n  -> dot_config/nvim/scripts/executable_setup.sh\n~/.ssh/config (private)\n  -> private_dot_ssh/private_config\n\nEncode each path component consistently.\nUse chezmoi-style attributes in names:\ndot_         leading dot in destination name\nprivate_     restrict destination permissions\nexecutable_  preserve executable permission\nempty_       retain empty files\nDefer empty directories: Git does not store them.\n\nUse canonical prefix ordering and escaping.\nRound-trip literal reserved names unambiguously.\nReject aliases that decode to the same path.\nNo templates or symlinks in the first version.\nNo UUIDs, fallback paths or entry manifests.\nActual file bytes are stored unchanged.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Destination                 Source path\n~/.zshrc                    dot_zshrc\n~/.config/nvim/init.lua\n  -> dot_config/nvim/init.lua\n~/.config/nvim/scripts/setup.sh (executable)\n  -> dot_config/nvim/scripts/executable_setup.sh\n~/.ssh/config (private)\n  -> private_dot_ssh/private_config\n\nEncode each path component consistently.\nUse chezmoi-style attributes in names:\ndot_         leading dot in destination name\nprivate_     restrict destination permissions\nexecutable_  preserve executable permission\nempty_       retain empty files\nDefer empty directories: Git does not store them.\n\nUse canonical prefix ordering and escaping.\nRound-trip literal reserved names unambiguously.\nReject aliases that decode to the same path.\nNo templates or symlinks in the first version.\nNo UUIDs, fallback paths or entry manifests.\nActual file bytes are stored unchanged.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "repo-guide-routing-card",
