      "versionNonce": 930014,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792242393208,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Read source entries from the managed clone.\n2. Decode names into relative destination paths.\n3. Match this device selected paths.\n4. Validate containment and reject collisions.\n5. Join decoded path beneath this device home.\n\nSame source: dot_config/nvim/lua/plugins.lua\nDevice A home = /home/alex\n  -> /home/alex/.config/nvim/lua/plugins.lua\nDevice B home = /Users/sam\n  -> /Users/sam/.config/nvim/lua/plugins.lua\n\nCapture uses the inverse mapping.\nAdd refreshes the existing source entry.\nUnchanged content is a no-op.\nRename is delete + add; no persistent IDs.\nInitially reject outside-home paths and symlinks.\nReject ../ escapes and decoded case collisions.\nCompare local contents before first apply.\nKeep applied hashes/revisions locally by path.\nAutomatic sync remains Abode-specific.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Read source entries from the managed clone.\n2. Decode names into relative destination paths.\n3. Match this device selected paths.\n4. Validate containment and reject collisions.\n5. Join decoded path beneath this device home.\n\nSame source: dot_config/nvim/lua/plugins.lua\nDevice A home = /home/alex\n  -> /home/alex/.config/nvim/lua/plugins.lua\nDevice B home = /Users/sam\n  -> /Users/sam/.config/nvim/lua/plugins.lua\n\nCapture uses the inverse mapping.\nAdd refreshes the existing source entry.\nUnchanged content is a no-op.\nRename is delete + add; no persistent IDs.\nInitially reject outside-home paths and symlinks.\nReject ../ escapes and decoded case collisions.\nCompare local contents before first apply.\nKeep applied hashes/revisions locally by path.\nAutomatic sync remains Abode-specific.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
